# Optional local intelligence overlays. Format: CIDR,label
#
# This is a starter template, not the live file: copy it to threat-cidrs.csv
# (gitignored -- see .gitignore and dashboard/geoip/README.md) to get started
# with manual entries only, or run ./refresh-threat-cidrs.sh (#244) to create
# threat-cidrs.csv and auto-populate it from Spamhaus DROP, the Tor bulk exit
# list, and AWS/GCP published ranges. When more than one CIDR matches the
# same address, the highest-severity label wins (blocklist:* > tor-exit >
# everything else), not file order -- see intelCategoryRank in geoip.go.
#
# 192.0.2.0/24,scanner
